WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.576 --> 00:00:15.262
Lady Yoo with Inhyun.

2
00:00:21.224 --> 00:00:24.646
They watched as servants prepared for Gildong's funeral.

3
00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:30.068
"I'm glad the servant boy is dead," Inhyun said.

4
00:00:31.376 --> 00:00:32.816
Lady Yoo patted him.

5
00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:36.838
"Now your father will love you best."

6
00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:49.541
Crack! Just then a bolt of lightning struck a tree.

7
00:00:50.301 --> 00:00:55.603
When the smoke cleared, Gildong stood on top of the tree, holding a fan.

8
00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:59.023
Everyone screamed.

9
00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:01.832
"It's a ghost!"

10
00:01:02.412 --> 00:01:04.933
Inhyun cried, hiding behind his mother.

11
00:01:06.614 --> 00:01:08.494
Lord Hong rushed outside.

12
00:01:08.514 --> 00:01:10.955
"Why is everyone screaming?"

13
00:01:15.676 --> 00:01:18.077
He saw Gildong and gulped.

14
00:01:18.097 --> 00:01:21.838
"Gildong's ghost has come for revenge.

15
00:01:22.998 --> 00:01:24.458
I should not have sent him away."

16
00:01:25.959 --> 00:01:27.639
Gildong scratched his head.

17
00:01:27.659 --> 00:01:29.300
"What ghost?

18
00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:30.620
I'm not a ghost."

19
00:01:31.668 --> 00:01:32.769
He jumped down.

20
00:01:38.074 --> 00:01:41.497
Lord Hong reached out and touched Gildong's robe.

21
00:01:41.517 --> 00:01:42.958
"You're alive?"

22
00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:46.661
"Of course I am," Gildong said.

23
00:01:46.681 --> 00:01:50.244
"Everyone said you fell from a cliff and died!"

24
00:01:50.704 --> 00:01:51.645
Lord Hong said.

25
00:01:51.665 --> 00:01:56.409
"I fell from a cliff, but I didn't die," Gildong said.

26
00:01:56.429 --> 00:01:59.352
"I just got back from the land of the gods."

27
00:02:01.136 --> 00:02:02.597
Lord Hong was puzzled.

28
00:02:02.617 --> 00:02:06.140
"Poor child, you must have hurt your head.

29
00:02:07.141 --> 00:02:08.121
But never mind that."

30
00:02:09.923 --> 00:02:11.644
He turned to address everyone.

31
00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:14.166
"There is no need for a funeral.

32
00:02:15.226 --> 00:02:18.229
Gildong is home, and he shall stay here for good!"

33
00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:28.116
In the morning Gildong went outside with his fan.

34
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.742
"It is time to learn how to use its magic," he thought.

35
00:02:34.842 --> 00:02:35.562
He opened it.

36
00:02:40.945 --> 00:02:43.626
A gust of wind blew hard around him.

37
00:02:45.307 --> 00:02:46.408
Gildong laughed.

38
00:02:47.588 --> 00:02:54.972
"Amazing!" He practiced using the fan all morning.

39
00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.321
Then Inhyun found him.

40
00:03:08.225 --> 00:03:08.605
me that!"

41
00:03:09.185 --> 00:03:10.666
Inhyun reached for the fan.

42
00:03:10.686 --> 00:03:14.509
"Float!" Gildong rose into the air.

43
00:03:16.651 --> 00:03:17.751
Inhyun gasped.

44
00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:21.014
"You must be a demon.

45
00:03:21.994 --> 00:03:23.075
How can you do that?"

46
00:03:23.095 --> 00:03:26.918
"Illusion!" Gildong cried.

47
00:03:26.938 --> 00:03:32.501
A giant snake appeared and hissed angrily at Inhyun.

48
00:03:32.521 --> 00:03:35.663
"Gildong is trying to kill me again!"

49
00:03:35.683 --> 00:03:39.005
Inhyun ran away, screaming.

50
00:03:42.246 --> 00:03:44.908
Poof! The snake disappeared.

51
00:03:46.089 --> 00:03:47.309
Gildong smiled.

52
00:03:47.329 --> 00:03:49.931
"I wonder what else this fan can do."

53
00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:56.894
Inhyun told his parents about Gildong's new powers.

54
00:03:58.495 --> 00:03:59.696
Lord Hong laughed.

55
00:04:00.913 --> 00:04:04.395
"Inhyun, don't make up stories.

56
00:04:05.336 --> 00:04:08.118
You should focus more on learning, like Gildong."

57
00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.421
Lady Yoo was furious at hearing this.

58
00:04:14.783 --> 00:04:16.344
She stormed to her room.

59
00:04:20.487 --> 00:04:21.468
wrong, my lady?"

60
00:04:21.969 --> 00:04:22.969
her maid asked.

61
00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.292
Lady Yoo stomped her foot.

62
00:04:27.332 --> 00:04:30.755
"I was happier when I thought the lowborn boy was dead!"

63
00:04:30.775 --> 00:04:36.258
"What if the boy died for real?"

64
00:04:36.699 --> 00:04:37.539
her maid said.

65
00:04:37.559 --> 00:04:42.162
"If you wish, I know someone who can help.

66
00:04:43.123 --> 00:04:46.826
Teukjae is the perfect man for the job."

67
00:04:50.488 --> 00:04:54.111
Lady Yoo's mouth twisted into a nasty smile.
